Jack Reacher: Never Go Back is a 2016 American action-thriller film directed by Edward Zwick, written by
Richard Wenk, Zwick, and Marshall Herskovitz, and based on the 2013 novel by Lee Child.

12
01:18:40,000 --> 01:18:46,000
A sequel to the 2012 film, the film stars Tom Cruise, reprising
his role as Jack Reacher, and Cobie Smulders.

13
01:25:13,333 --> 01:25:19,333
The plot follows Reacher going on the run with an Army major who has been
framed for espionage, as the two reveal a dark conspiracy.

14
01:31:46,666 --> 01:31:52,666
Principal photography began on October 20, 2015, in New Orleans,
and the film was released on October 21, 2016.

15
